# Daydream: "target creature you control". Bot2's Ornithopter is refused (CR 115.1); the positive control is Bot1's
# own Ornithopter, which the same Daydream may target, and which comes back with its counter.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Ornithopter
Daydream
Plains x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Plains x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
! Bot1.Hand.Daydream.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Hand.Daydream.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Pearl; Ornithopter
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 1
Bot2.Battlefield = Ornithopter
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 0
Bot1.Graveyard = Daydream
